<p>Lay a tricky trap that maims creatures passing by with acid doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">198, 235, 264, 289, 310</acronym> damage and disarming them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p>